  "date": "2026-09-28T11:39:28-05:00",
  "subject": "chore: bump version to v1.0.2023",
  "body": "Signed-off-by: Zach Aller <zach_aller@intuit.com>\n",
  "references": [
    {
      "commit": {
        "author": "\"svc-ci\" <code@example.com>",
        "date": "2026-09-19T20:45:31-05:00",
        "subject": "feat(ps)!: move promotion logic to DependentsSuccessfulCommitStatus (#1972)",
        "body": "* feat(ps)!: move promotion logic to DAGCommitStatus\n\nIntroduce DAGCommitStatus for graph-based promotion ordering and\nPreviousEnvironmentCommitStatus for the existing linear chain. PromotionStrategy\nno longer injects previous-environment gating; strategies must declare an\nordering gate explicitly.\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>\nSigned-off-by: Michael Crenshaw <350466+crenshaw-dev@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* consolidate in DAG CRD\n\nSigned-off-by: Michael Crenshaw <350466+crenshaw-dev@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* rename CRD\n\nSigned-off-by: Michael Crenshaw <350466+crenshaw-dev@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* more tests\n\nSigned-off-by: Michael Crenshaw <350466+crenshaw-dev@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>\n\n* fix(controller): thread resolved dependsOn into DSC URL templates (#18)\n\nWhen spec.environments is omitted, URL template vars .DependsOn and\n.DependsOnQuery were empty because rendering read the spec directly\ninstead of the graph inferred from PromotionStrategy order.\n\nSigned-off-by: Zach Aller <zachaller@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* allow setting check on all envs\n\nSigned-off-by: Michael Crenshaw <350466+crenshaw-dev@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* fix(controller): guard missing upstream status in DSC gate (#19)\n\nExplicitly treat a missing statusByBranch entry as pending instead of\nrelying on zero-value EnvironmentStatus and vacuous commit-status passing.\n\nSigned-off-by: Zach Aller <zachaller@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* fix(api): add omitempty to DSC spec.environments (#20)\n\nOmitted inferred-chain mode no longer marshals \"environments\": null;\nthe field is absent instead, matching +optional and applyconfiguration.\n\nSigned-off-by: Zach Aller <zachaller@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* fix(controller): index DSC enqueue by promotionStrategyRef (#21)\n\nUse MatchingFields on the existing PromotionStrategyRef field index\ninstead of namespace-wide list-and-filter when a PromotionStrategy changes.\n\nSigned-off-by: Zach Aller <zachaller@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* test(controller): remove stale CTP-owned DAG gate assertion (#22)\n\nGate CommitStatuses are owned by DependentsSuccessfulCommitStatus now;\nfiltering by CTP owner always yielded 0 and the Expect(0) was vacuous.\n\nSigned-off-by: Zach Aller <zachaller@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* docs: add atomic API separation-of-concerns section\n\nDocument the rationale for extracting promotion ordering into\nDependentsSuccessfulCommitStatus, including linear vs DAG examples.\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>\nSigned-off-by: Michael Crenshaw <350466+crenshaw-dev@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* docs: add 0.38 upgrading guide and sync ordering gate docs\n\nDocument DependentsSuccessfulCommitStatus migration from auto-injected\nordering, fix stale rename artifacts, and clarify per-environment\nproposedCommitStatuses safety-check behavior.\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>\nSigned-off-by: Michael Crenshaw <350466+crenshaw-dev@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* fixes\n\nSigned-off-by: Michael Crenshaw <350466+crenshaw-dev@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* feat(controller): emit CommitStatusPhaseChanged events from DSC (#24)\n\nEmit transition-only CommitStatusPhaseChanged events when per-environment\nordering gate phases change, matching other built-in gate controllers.\n\nSigned-off-by: Zach Aller <zachaller@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* feat(controller): auto-delete legacy previous-environment CommitStatuses (#27)\n\n* feat(controller): auto-delete legacy previous-environment CommitStatuses\n\nAfter DSC reconciles for a PromotionStrategy, remove orphaned\npromoter-previous-environment CommitStatuses owned by its CTPs and\ndocument automatic cleanup in upgrading.md.\n\nSigned-off-by: Zach Aller <zachaller@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* short circuit\n\nSigned-off-by: Zach Aller <zachaller@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n---------\n\nSigned-off-by: Zach Aller <zachaller@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* docs: add apiVersion to 0.38 migration YAML examples (#26)\n\nMake the PromotionStrategy and DependentsSuccessfulCommitStatus\nsnippets in upgrading.md copy-paste ready.\n\nSigned-off-by: Zach Aller <zachaller@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* fix lint\n\nSigned-off-by: Michael Crenshaw <350466+crenshaw-dev@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n---------\n\nSigned-off-by: Michael Crenshaw <350466+crenshaw-dev@users.noreply.github.com>\nSigned-off-by: Zach Aller <zachaller@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: Lynn Yu <yu.kaiyi@northeastern.edu>\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>\nCo-authored-by: Zach Aller <zachaller@users.noreply.github.com>",
        "sha": "397fe2bcad9002fab23eec8e8c04ad848d0f5bbb",
        "repoUrl": "https://github.com/argoproj-labs/gitops-promoter"
      }
    }
  ]
}
